{"src":"ru","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":219600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ru","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5218.347725,"text":"Однако после потери калитки капитана Индия..."},{"kind":"text","t":5435.971363000001,"text":"However, after the loss of Captain India's gate..."},{"kind":"audio","t":5489.505902999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":5495.2117020000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":5498.334477,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":10642.102762,"text":"Совершила лишь 36 пробегов, потеряв 7 калиток для завершения."},{"kind":"text","t":10923.05804,"text":"It made only 36 runs, losing 7 gates to completion."},{"kind":"audio","t":10977.904461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10983.018928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10988.405322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10991.690924999999,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":13086.122836,"text":"и нинксов."},{"kind":"text","t":13195.429333,"text":"and nixes."},{"kind":"audio","t":13245.388394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":13245.809967,"samples":6832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":22116.824244,"text":"В них обычно предлагается особая еда, напитки и развлечения, чтобы гости оставались в хорошем настроении и не покидали заведение."},{"kind":"text","t":22562.840457,"text":"They usually offer special food, drinks, and entertainment to keep guests in a good mood and prevent them from leaving the establishment."},{"kind":"audio","t":22625.580145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22631.010048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22636.107766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22641.794815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22646.801944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22651.726074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22655.042617,"samples":27792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":33392.534954,"text":"Дальпотр имел раннее преимущество во втором сете, но это также потребовало тайпбрейка после достижения..."},{"kind":"text","t":33795.811334000005,"text":"Dalpotr had an early advantage in the second set, but it also required a tiebreak after reaching..."},{"kind":"audio","t":33865.922007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":33871.38102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33876.861452000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33882.66691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33888.159531000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":33888.646344,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":42555.101396000005,"text":"Интернет сочетает в себе элементы как массовых, так и межличностных коммуникаций."},{"kind":"text","t":42786.665766000006,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":42843.027066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42844.269838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42845.473131000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42847.075868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":42847.448763,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54598.462239,"text":"Во время сравнения при помощи инфракрасной фурье-спектроскопии выяснилось, что состав этих кристаллов соответствует кристаллам, найденным в моче пораженных домашних животных."},{"kind":"text","t":55063.61204,"text":"Comparison using Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy revealed that the composition of these crystals corresponds to the crystals found in the urine of affected pets."},{"kind":"audio","t":55129.147539000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55130.678027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55132.61159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55134.37867400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55136.354876000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55138.337178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55140.31809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55142.223093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55143.468205000005,"samples":28256,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":68946.497449,"text":"На некоторых маршрутов у более крупных компаний есть свои собственные самолеты, но для других маршрутов и более мелких компаний с этим была проблема."},{"kind":"text","t":69416.665223,"text":"Some of the larger companies have their own aircraft on certain routes, but for other routes and smaller companies, this was a problem."},{"kind":"audio","t":69469.625289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69475.306109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69480.716533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69485.852321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69491.30373500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69496.727038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69499.830445,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":78918.24769,"text":"Некоторые атомы имеют нестабильное ядро, что означает, что они склонны распадаться при малом воздействии или без него."},{"kind":"text","t":79312.058867,"text":"Some atoms have an unstable nucleus, which means they are prone to decay with little or no external influence."},{"kind":"audio","t":79371.256206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79376.538272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":79381.80315800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79387.142793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79392.505517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79396.94326500001,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":84458.433013,"text":"В том же месяце другой авиалайнер выкатился за пределы взлетной полосы."},{"kind":"text","t":84706.734395,"text":"In the same month, another airliner overran the runway."},{"kind":"audio","t":84749.97313700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":84755.092695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":84760.410651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":84761.228499,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":89339.945591,"text":"Меш Хеди и врезался в стену. Погибли 17 человек."},{"kind":"text","t":89523.137757,"text":"Mesh Hedi crashed into a wall. 17 people died."},{"kind":"audio","t":89575.037328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89579.791241,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"audio","t":89647.352182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89650.228751,"samples":23632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":97423.682598,"text":"Почти все эти пляжи песчаные с безопасным купанием, и многие из них тенистые благодаря таким деревьям, как Пахутукапа."},{"kind":"text","t":97906.329667,"text":"Almost all of these beaches are sandy with safe swimming, and many of them are shaded by trees such as the Pahutukapa."},{"kind":"audio","t":97975.10603000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97980.504555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97985.710041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":97991.102906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97996.46124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98001.713477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":98001.907904,"samples":1392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":110852.983872,"text":"В популярные виды спорта входят футбол, баскетбол, волейбол, водное поло, фехтование, регби, велоспорт, хоккей на льду, хоккей на роликах и автогонки формула 1."},{"kind":"text","t":111391.017213,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":111462.93221300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111468.228698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111473.479044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111478.898508,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111483.968877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111489.15077400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111493.74539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111496.911685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":111497.205501,"samples":56,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116947.65049500001,"text":"В теплом климате Ближнего Востока дом не имел особого значения."},{"kind":"text","t":117248.65760600001,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the home held little significance."},{"kind":"audio","t":117303.54389500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117308.443146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":117313.699362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117317.36196000001,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":127779.753729,"text":"Архипелаг располагается в 120 километрах от полуострова. Крупнейший остров носит имя короля Георга с поселением Вилье-Лас-Эстрельес."},{"kind":"text","t":128191.809909,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 kilometers from the peninsula. The largest island is named after King George and includes the settlement of Ville-les-Étoiles."},{"kind":"audio","t":128257.22882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128262.39514800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128267.799262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128273.35830400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":128273.69953900001,"samples":8128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":128331.20809100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128336.563596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128341.58455500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128346.872591,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128351.564345,"samples":31528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":138503.302828,"text":"Капустный сок меняет цвет в зависимости от того, насколько кислотным или щелочным является химическое вещество."},{"kind":"text","t":138818.24375300002,"text":"Cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic or alkaline a chemical substance is."},{"kind":"audio","t":138874.55210200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138879.570931,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138884.763849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138890.090724,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138893.504546,"samples":24328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":154153.315802,"text":"Согласно плану, мост полностью войдет в эксплуатацию в сентябре 2017 года, когда бразильские пункты таможенной проверки, как ожидается,"},{"kind":"text","t":154625.089184,"text":"According to the plan, the bridge will become fully operational in September 2017, when Brazilian customs checkpoints are expected to"},{"kind":"audio","t":154700.879059,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154705.681072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154711.077696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154716.345652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154721.48928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154726.751376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":154731.560468,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154731.975232,"samples":18424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":154803.883952,"text":"будут завершены."},{"kind":"text","t":154906.55202,"text":"be completed."},{"kind":"audio","t":154955.969475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":154956.32145000002,"samples":8032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":164348.50471500002,"text":"Влага на наших руках вступит в реакцию с верхним слоем, что будет необычно, затем сформируется подобие оболочки."},{"kind":"text","t":164812.528675,"text":"Moisture on our hands will react with the top layer, which will be unusual, and then a sort of shell will form."},{"kind":"audio","t":164862.959727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164868.073495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164873.04584500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164878.326681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":164883.715305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164887.028979,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":171855.82382,"text":"Одна из бомб взорвалась возле офиса генерал-губернатора."},{"kind":"text","t":172130.342123,"text":"One of the bombs exploded near the governor-general's office."},{"kind":"audio","t":172183.606085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":172189.140407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172194.691949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":172194.960675,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":178847.618429,"text":"Султан Марокко перестроил город под названием Эддар-эль-Бейда."},{"kind":"text","t":179154.163822,"text":"The Sultan of Morocco rebuilt a city called Ed-dar el-Beida."},{"kind":"audio","t":179210.623858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179215.47997000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179220.73225600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":179222.421833,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":183995.995306,"text":"А испанские торговцы, создавшие тут торговые базы, назвали его Касабланка."},{"kind":"text","t":184283.405088,"text":"And the Spanish merchants, who established trading posts here, called it Casablanca."},{"kind":"audio","t":184340.870921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184346.221166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184351.235215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184356.949745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":184357.244841,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":196243.04795100002,"text":"Его приветствовал заместитель премьер-министра Сингапура Вонг Кан Сенг. Затем он обсудил вопросы торговли и терроризма с премьер-министром Сингапура Ли Сянь Луном."},{"kind":"text","t":196599.095859,"text":"He was welcomed by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan Seng. He then discussed trade and terrorism issues with Singaporean Prime Minister Lee Hsien Loong."},{"kind":"audio","t":196667.063674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196672.232522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196677.36216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196680.681823,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"audio","t":196721.932183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196727.269918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":196732.181539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196737.693162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196742.520304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"audio","t":196742.668872,"samples":560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207934.733489,"text":"Атомная бомба работает на том принципе, что для того, чтобы много протонов и нейтронов находились в одном ядре, необходима энергия."},{"kind":"text","t":208363.318867,"text":"An atomic bomb works on the principle that energy is required for many protons and neutrons to remain within a single nucleus."},{"kind":"audio","t":208425.587152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208430.869098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":208436.188713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208441.509299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208446.673466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208452.07442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208455.838097,"samples":25992,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":217895.538134,"text":"Исследуя архипелаги или посещая озёра, вы вполне сможете обойтись и без яхты."},{"kind":"text","t":218243.294548,"text":"Whether exploring archipelagos or visiting lakes, you can easily get by without a yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":218290.194259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218295.278298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218300.502854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218305.901218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218309.841593,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"close","t":229605.216908,"code":1005}]}